P09 / FINDING-028 / FINDING-029 prototype (session 9, 2026-10-14). NOT the fix: measuring switches only.
Apply to a scratch copy of dieselsim/ (patch -p0), never to the repo. Every switch defaults off. With the first
switches (P09, P09_CAP) off, the copy matched the repo at 27 of 27 points exactly; that was not re-run after
the later switches were added (each is guarded, but unchecked). Environment switches:
  P09=1          V1: the premixed burn's duration loses its 30*phi term
  P09_CAP=x      the premix fraction's cap (0.72)
  P09_A=a        V3: d_pre * (P09_TREF ms / delay)^a   (dropped: single10's burn 3x faster at sea level)
  P09_B=b        V4: d_pre / max(1, delay / injection duration)^b
  P09_FLOOR=d    the floor on d_pre for V3/V4 (2.0 deg)
  P09_CUM=1      the main burn integrated exactly over each step (the cumulative Wiebe's difference)
  P09_FWD=1      the sound's dpdt_max by a forward difference (as dpdtheta_comb)
  P09_KN=1       the sound's dpdt_max from the burn law: peak (gamma-1)/V * dQ/dtheta on 8 sub-steps per step
  F28_EPS=e      FINDING-028 option B, first attempt: orifice flow linear in dp below 1-pr = e (does not work)
Numbers: reviews/FINDING-028.md, reviews/FINDING-029.md, reviews/PROPOSAL-P09.md.

